8. PARAMETERS AND ARGUMENTS
------------------------------------------------------------

Parameter:
    Variable written in function definition/declaration.

Argument:
    Actual value supplied during function call.

Example:

int add(int a, int b)
{
    return a + b;
}

int main(void)
{
    add(10, 20);
