31. STATIC FUNCTION
------------------------------------------------------------

At file scope:

static int helper(int x)
{
    return x * 2;
}

A file-scope static function has internal linkage.

That means it is intended to be accessible only within the
same translation unit/source file.

This is useful for implementation-private helper functions.


