32. INLINE FUNCTIONS
------------------------------------------------------------

C supports the `inline` function specifier.

Example:

static inline int square(int x)
{
    return x * x;
}

Important:

`inline` is a request/optimization hint, not a guarantee that
the compiler will replace every call with the function body.

Modern optimizing compilers make their own decisions.


