34. FUNCTION POINTER SYNTAX
------------------------------------------------------------

General:

return_type (*pointer_name)(parameter_types);


Example:

int (*fp)(int, int);


Can point to:

int add(int a, int b)
{
    return a + b;
}


Assignment:

fp = add;

or:

fp = &add;


