------------------------------------------------------------

Suppose:

main.c
math.c
math.h

Compile:

gcc -Wall -Wextra -std=c17 main.c math.c -o app

Or separately:

gcc -Wall -Wextra -std=c17 -c main.c
gcc -Wall -Wextra -std=c17 -c math.c

Then:

gcc main.o math.o -o app


