85. GATE-LEVEL RECURSION COMPLEXITY
------------------------------------------------------------

Consider:

int f(int n)
{
    if (n <= 1)
        return 1;

    return f(n - 1) + 1;
}

How many recursive calls?

Approximately:

n

Time complexity:

O(n)

Stack space:

O(n)


